Yes — LangGraph is a Python package/module, installable via pip, same as langchain or chromadb.

Quick facts:

pip install langgraph

Yes — you can absolutely import LangGraph into your rag-project (or any new project), same pattern as everything else you've done today.

from langgraph.graph import StateGraph

What it is:
LangGraph lets you build multi-step, stateful AI agents as a graph of nodes (steps) and edges (connections) — instead of a simple one-shot LLM call, you define a workflow where the agent can loop, branch, retry, and make decisions across multiple steps.

How it relates to what you've been learning:

+----------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
