+----------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Plain LLM call | Ask a question → get one answer.                                                           |
|                |                                                                                            |
| LangChain      | Chains multiple LLM calls/tools together in a fixed sequence.                              |
|                |                                                                                            |
| LangGraph      | Lets you build flexible, branching workflows — the agent can loop back, retry,            |
|                | or take different paths based on results (like a flowchart/state machine for AI agents).  |
+----------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

