Practical example:

An agent using LangGraph could: check Kubernetes pod status → if CrashLoopBackOff found → fetch logs → analyze error → if fix is known → apply fix → re-check status → loop until resolved or max retries hit. This branching/looping logic is exactly what LangGraph is designed to structure.

